29092216492,"text_excerpt":"As a student at Loyola University and an uptown resident, this is where I go when I can't figure out what to eat and I know the pizza is always above average. For $3.25, you get a huge slice of cheese pizza... Cheaper than Slice and better. Don't let the looks of this place deceive you. I love this pizza... It is amazing. It tastes even better if you're drunk. I guess that's why having The Boot right next door makes sense."},{"business_id":"7EsXQiL_88dcjIPmVfo_0A","review_id":"N6Qh7u9NuLdIgieQdA1PTw","date":"2011-08-31T01:35:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9188274145126343,"text_excerpt":"I can't believe that Dough Bowl doesn't rate better! Boot pizza is one of my favorite pizzas of all time. It is delicious, New York style with the perfect crust (which really makes or breaks a pizza, in my opinion). They sell by the slice or giant pie and are open until very late. I come here often, both drunk and sober, to get my pizza fix. Aside from the occasional slow customer service experience (what do you expect when all the workers are stoned college students?), this place is awesome."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
